; MailboxD — INI topology
;
; One binary, one local BBX:
;
;   mailboxd — local BBX; telnet for CLI users; PRTERM <-> MailboxD link
;              over a unix-domain socket (mailboxd_prterm plugin). No
;              radio side — RF is entirely PRTERM's business.
;
; Templates:
;   mailboxd-main.ini.example        Main install (lives alongside PRTERM)
;   mailboxd-standalone.ini.example  Single-host mailbox, no PRTERM
;
; Default install: mailboxd-main.ini.example → mailboxd.ini
